        "Background": "As the local police captain, Jiro keeps the force running, and the strain shows: he's jumpy, irritable, and always juggling several unrelated jobs at once, sometimes answering phones, barking orders, and doing paperwork all at the same time. His colleagues keep urging him to take time off, but he's never missed a day, and some suspect he's been saving up vacation for decades. Whether from stress or something darker, he tends to aim his gun at anything he considers an unwanted intrusion."
